#: ../../source/docs/common-cubepilot-cubenodeeth.rst:11
#: fbff5a9d46b74895b61fc8f793c3210c
msgid "The `CubePilot CubeNode ETH <https://docs.cubepilot.org/user-guides/cubenode/cubenode-eth>`__ ethernet adapter allows STM32 H7 autopilots without built-in ethernet support to connect to ethernet peripherals.  This is often used in combination with a `CubeLAN 8 Port Switch <https://docs.cubepilot.org/user-guides/switch/cubelan-8-port-switch>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-cubepilot-cubenodeeth.rst:13
